I wonder if we should make this more consistent with what we have on the server side:

https://github.com/netty/netty/blob/4.1/codec-http2/src/main/java/io/netty/handler/codec/http2/Http2ServerUpgradeCodec.java#L107

Basically:

public Http2ClientUpgradeCodec(Http2FrameCodec http2Codec, ChannelHandler... handlers) {
     ...
}

